<title>USA: Sherwin-Williams Co sets qtly div $0.10.</title>
<headline>Sherwin-Williams Co sets qtly div $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sherwin-Williams Co on Wednesday said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.10 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable June 6 to shareholders of record on May 6.</p>
<p>The latest dividend is the same as the prior dividend of $0.20 per share after the effect of a two-for-one stock split.</p>
</text>
